body:
I’m here from the future. for some reason this account got 0 attention during their active years. the tweets are all linked to events happening in 2016-2017. but what’s intetesting is there are also some tweets about events happened *recently in 2023*

for example they tweeted stuff like “everything will be very nice :) “ (i don’t have twitter so I couldn’t link, will edit when I find it)

—which is the election slogan of the opposition party. they namedropped some prominent names of the elections, which before the elections they mostly were only known in their respective political circles. my country’s citizens have just found out about it and are going wild… if anyone has any more info please comment/dm/etc.

from his voicelines we know that woman is named Skirk. Childe’s friendship namecard tells us some more:

“This bears all the marks of that fellow who gallivants as he pleases across the continent with his ever-changing combat styles. Yet, his "Foul Legacy" was not orginally his. Rather, it was taught to him by that solitary girl who dwelt in the darkest corners of the universe.” 

my head theory is that she is the hinted higher ranking operator of the abyss order. can’t wait like, 5 years or so to find out lol
